  "Name": "REPLENISH_PICKFACE",
  "Description": "REPLENISH PICKFACE\n\nIntended for use where pickface locations do not contain physical TrackingEntity barcodes. When you replenish to a location that already contains the MasterItem being replenished, it will add to the existing TrackingEntity. If the MasterItem does not yet exist in the pickface location, a new TrackingEntity will be created.\n\nPickface locations must have type PICKFACE assigned.\n\nEnsure your pickface locations type is set to PICKFACE. SQLCLR procedures must be deployed and configured to use this process.",
